<tme type="text">THE PEDDLER’S GIFT, by Maxine Rose Schur. Copyright © 1999 by Maxine Rose Schur. Reproduced by permission of Dial Books for Young Readers, a division of Penguin Group (USA) Inc.</tme></block>
